      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你，\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60FF0C000A0010000201000000FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多亏了你，我才能打上一场\n动真格的对战……而且，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我还回想起了以前打过的某场宝贵的对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A4E8F4E864F60FF0C6211624D80FD62534E0A4E00573A000A52A8771F683C76845BF9621820262026800C4E14FF0C00100001BE00000A62118FD856DE60F38D774E864EE5524D62538FC7768467D0573A5B9D8D3576845BF96218300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来到密阿雷，\n能够遇见你们真的是太好了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
